   {
      RETURN(true)
   }
   RETURN(false)
}
```
A passing score is 70 or higher.

The procedure max(list) is intended to return the largest value in a list of numbers.
```
PROCEDURE max(list)
{
   biggest ← 0
   FOR EACH n IN list
   {
      IF (n > biggest)
      {
         biggest ← n
      }
   }
   RETURN(biggest)
}
```

