A student's program helps a club track volunteer hours. It contains this procedure:
```
PROCEDURE totalHours(hoursList, minHours)
{
   total ← 0
   FOR EACH h IN hoursList
   {
      IF (h ≥ minHours)
      {
         total ← total + h
      }
   }
   RETURN(total)
}
```
The program calls totalHours(clubHours, 2), where clubHours is a list of the hours logged for each volunteer shift.
